WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.636
UNION ALL is a straightforward unpivot pattern Write
one SELECT

00:00:05.662 --> 00:00:12.869
for each source column Give each SELECT the same
output structure Then

00:00:12.895 --> 00:00:18.577
stack the rows with UNION ALL This is verbose but
very beginner-friendly

00:00:18.603 --> 00:00:21.419
because each source column is visible in its own
SELECT
